### Uploaded files (local file storage) ###
# Not anchored to root: LocalFileStorageService/LocalAvatarStorageService resolve "storage/..."
# relative to the JVM's working directory, which differs depending on how spring-boot:run is
# launched (repo root vs. from japp-core/ directly) — so this needs to match at any depth.
storage/

